LogChunks 1.0.0
Carolin Brandt, Annibale Panichella and Moritz Beller (Delft University of
Technology), "LogChunks: A Data Set for Build Log Analysis", MSR 2020.
https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.3632351
License: Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0)
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

Used by the CI triage example (examples/ci-triage), which downloads it
(pinned by sha256) and never redistributes it. Changes made: the annotated
chunks are matched to the rendered log lines to label each line; logs are
split by repository; each chunk gets a failure category, from rules on the
training and validation sets and checked by hand on the test set
(examples/ci-triage/data/test-categories.tsv, derived from LogChunks, same
license). Details: docs/CI-TRIAGE-EVAL.md.
